# 10_sokkon only treats a press inside its focus ring as a focus toggle. A
# simulator that could only reach the centre of the panel could not show that.
NOTE The ring is 145 px around the centre of a 466 px panel.
SHOT idle

NOTE Near the top edge, 173 px out: the firmware must ignore it.
TOUCH 233 60
SHOT outside-ring

NOTE Dead centre: the focus timer starts.
TOUCH 233 233
ADVANCE 3000
SHOT inside-ring

NOTE A corner press is outside the ring and also outside the round glass.
TOUCH 400 400
ADVANCE 1000
SHOT corner-ignored
